   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Convictus Ukraine</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to Convictus Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">De f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade projektresultaten &#xe4;r: att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra organisatorisk och  professionell kapacitet av den ukrainska enskilda organisationen      Convictus Ukraine; och att testa HWH-modellen f&#xf6;r kvinnliga f.d.      f&#xe5;ngar s&#xe5; att modellen blir en del av det ukrainska rehabiliterings-  och friv&#xe5;rdssystemet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The immediate objectives of the project are: to improve               organisational and professional capacity of the Ukrainian NGO         Convictus Ukraine; and to pilot a Half-Way House model for women      ex-convicts so that it becomes an integral part of the Ukrainian      rehabilitation and probation systems.</narrative>
  </description>
